# The Hype over Hyperbolic Browsers.

**Authors:** Allen, Maryellen Mott

## Abstract
Considers complaints about the usability in the human-computer interaction aspect of information retrieval and discusses information visualization, the Online Library of Information Visualization Environments, hyperbolic information structure, subject searching, real-world applications, relational databases and hyperbolic trees, and the future of visual information structures. Provides a list of pertinent Web sites. (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ650898

